<title>RUSSIA: Russia to mull rate cuts in two-three weeks.</title>
<headline>Russia to mull rate cuts in two-three weeks.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Central Bank will consider cutting interest rates in two to three weeks' time because of increased demand for funds from Russian commercial banks, Central Bank first deputy chairman Sergei Aleksashenko said on Friday.</p>
</text>
